utes branded and private label RTE cereal under Weetabix and Alpen brands; hot cereals and other cereal-based food products; private label cereals; and protein-based shakes under the UFIT brand, and nutritional snacks. The Foodservice segment produces and distributes egg products primarily under Papetti's and Abbotsford Farms brands, as well as potato products in the foodservice and food ingredient channels. The segment also manufactures certain meat products. The Refrigerated Retail segment produces and distributes side dish, potato, sausage products under Bob Evans, Bob Evans Farms, and Simply Potatoes brands; eggs and egg products under Bob Evans Egg Whites and Egg Beaters brands; and cheese and other dairy products under Crystal Farms brand. It serves grocery stores, mass merchandise customers, supercenters, club stores, natural/specialty stores, dollar stores, discounters, wholesalers, convenience stores, pet supply retailers, drug store customers, foodservice distributors, and national restaurant chains, as well as sells its products in the military, ecommerce, and foodservice channels. The company was founded in 1895 and is headquartered in Saint Louis, Missouri.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"2040","sic_desc":"Grain Mill Products","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","mcap":3288606464,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"ST. LOUIS, MO","exchange":"XNYS","fy_end":"0930","cik":1530950,"state_inc":"MO","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":1945400000.0,"rev_yoy":23.2,"eps":1.0,"eps_yoy":-21.3,"ni":65700000.0,"ni_yoy":-21.7,"nm":3.4,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":1965900000.0,"rev_yoy":25.5,"eps":1.35,"eps_yoy":-11.2,"ni":88100000.0,"ni_yoy":-4.